@meeting vesselJob
// SW4, the Veyli vessel: Monday Day 29, 09:20 (after any Monday briefing), the Works bay. Calder gives you the job;
// then the helper card (pick two: event.veyliVessel.help.card.*, each pick answers with help.<id>.pick, then
// help.done). No reply here: the card is the choice. Basil is a week aboard; Pell only if his story kept him aboard.
title: Taavek's part
from: Chief Ines Calder
gist: Chief Calder gave you Taavek's part to make: the impeller, on the machine shop lathe, with Taavek and two helpers you pick.
== lines
calder: {me}. A minute.   [gesture]
calder: Taavek's part. It's yours.
taavek: The round one! We make it. Today. Yes.   [laugh]
calder: Machine shop. Their sketch, our stock, the lathe. Taavek beside you.
calder > you: Pick two. Don't pick me, I'll only hover.   [nod]
taavek: She will hover. I see it already.   [laugh]
calder: Done by three. Taavek's Tern goes at three.   [gesture]
